# Dependencies
/build/
/.dart_tool/
/.packages
.packages
.pub/

# pubspec.lock IS committed. GhostCopy is an application, not a library, so the
# lockfile is what makes a build reproducible across machines and CI. It was
# ignored until 2026-09-15; the cost showed up as CI resolving material_ui
# 1.3.0 against the pinned Flutter 3.44.8 and failing to compile on every
# native target, while the same commit built fine locally on 1.2.0.

